  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal singleprofile models with pca_n2000 and resnet50 have moderate accuracy. This experiment tests the effect of replacing pca_n2000 with scvi_n200 (a more complex RNA encoder) while keeping other settings identical. It isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice, a critical design decision, and addresses uncertainty about whether more sophisticated encoders improve performance without changing multiple parameters."
}

